Record microphone and computer playback locally

Usage:
  ambient-recorder [flags] [command]

Available Commands:
├─ recording          Capture microphone and computer playback
│  ╰─ start           Record continuously until interrupted
╰─ service            Configure recording in the background
   ╰─ print           Print a macOS configuration that restarts recording after exit

Flags:
  -h, --help      help for ambient-recorder
  -v, --version   version for ambient-recorder

Use "ambient-recorder [command] --help" for more information about a command.
